<title>JAPAN: Yokogawa to change company rule for share buy-back.</title>
<headline>Yokogawa to change company rule for share buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yokogawa Electric Corp said on Tuesday that it plans to buy back up to 25.9 million of its own shares and change company regulations to carry out the repurchase more swiftly.</p>
</text>
